            <div xml:id="preface">

                <pb facs="0007" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Preface</head>
                <p>Dr. E. Ralph Perkins, former Chief of the Foreign Relations Division, directly
                    supervised the preparation of this volume. He was assisted by the present Chief
                    of the Division, S. Everett Gleason, by Fredrick Aandahl, and by former staff
                    member, Almon E. Wright.</p>
                <p>The compilers of the volume were David H. Stauffer and Mr. Wright. Mr. Stauffer
                    was primarily responsible for documenting American policy toward Mexico, the
                    republics of Central America, and the Caribbean area. Mr. Wright’s work
                    encompassed the relations of the United States with the nations of South America
                    and with Panama. Documentation on the regional policies of the United States
                    toward the other American republics was the joint effort of Messrs. Wright and
                    Stauffer.</p>
                <p>The Publishing and Reproduction Services Division (Jerome H. Perlmutter, Chief)
                    was responsible for the technical editing of the volume.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William M. Franklin</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Director, Historical Office</hi>, <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bureau of Public Affairs</hi>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1968-12-31"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >December</hi> 31, 1968</date></dateline></closer>


